OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1787428109
OL,3,CJersey wins first Commonwealth Games
OL,4,Cmedal in 36 years
OL,6,FFilip Nowacki has won silver in the
OL,7,FMen's 100m Breaststroke Final at the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Games, securing Jersey's
OL,9,Ffirst medal in 36 years.
OL,11,FThe 18-year-old finished in 59.34
OL,12,Fseconds, just 0.17 seconds behind
OL,13,FAustralian champion Sam Williamson on
OL,14,FSaturday night (25 July).
OL,16,FNowacki also narrowly beat three-time
OL,17,FOlympic champion Adam Ramsay-Peaty,
OL,18,Fwho finished 0.31 seconds behind with
OL,19,Fa 59.65.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
