PN,35902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1787428109
OL,3,CJersey wins first Commonwealth Games
OL,4,Cmedal in 36 years
OL,6,FSpeaking to ITV News he said: "I'm
OL,7,Freally happy with that swim, just a
OL,8,Ftouch outside my PB but it's a true
OL,9,Fprivilege racing Adam, the Aussies,
OL,10,Fthe very best in the world and in a
OL,11,Fsenior environment.
OL,13,F"I'd obviously love to win but beating
OL,14,FAdam, beating all the rest, is truly
OL,15,Famazing and it gives me confidence
OL,16,Fgoing forwards.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,360,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1787428109
OL,3,CJersey wins first Commonwealth Games
OL,4,Cmedal in 36 years
OL,6,F"My training's been really good, I've
OL,7,Ftrained very hard. It's definitely
OL,8,Fbeen a challenging year, in the sense
OL,9,Fthat I'm getting older, I'm learning a
OL,10,Flot about myself."
OL,12,FIt's Jersey's first Commonwealth Games
OL,13,Fmedal since Colin Mallett won
OL,14,Findividual gold in the Full Bore Rifle
OL,15,Fevent and bronze with his father
OL,16,FCliff, at Auckland in 1990.
OL,18,FThe result is also the island's first
OL,19,Fmedal in swimming and its first silver
OL,20,Fat a senior Commonwealth Games.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
