PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1787428109
OL,3,CJersey wins first Commonwealth Games
OL,4,Cmedal in 36 years
OL,6,FIt comes after a hugely successful
OL,7,Fyear for the reigning double world
OL,8,Fjunior champion.
OL,10,FNowacki won the 100m and 200m
OL,11,Fbreaststroke titles at the 2025 World
OL,12,FJunior Championships and collected
OL,13,Ffour gold medals at the European
OL,14,FJunior Championships.
OL,16,FHe also won multiple gold medals while
OL,17,Frepresenting Jersey at the 2025 Island
OL,18,FGames in Orkney.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
