PN,35905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1787428109
OL,3,CJersey wins first Commonwealth Games
OL,4,Cmedal in 36 years
OL,6,FIn April, he claimed his first senior
OL,7,FBritish title by winning the 200m
OL,8,Fbreaststroke in 2:08.52.
OL,10,FJersey swimming coach Nathan Jegou
OL,11,Fsaid: "You wouldn't know he was
OL,12,Fnervous at all, biggest race of his
OL,13,Flife probably.
OL,15,F"I think we're more excited than he
OL,16,Fhis, he knows he's got another job to
OL,17,Fdo later in the week.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
