OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,360,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1787428109
OL,3,CJersey wins first Commonwealth Games
OL,4,Cmedal in 36 years
OL,6,F"It's huge for the island, huge for
OL,7,Fthe club. Just even his friends here
OL,8,Fsupporting, the amount of people from
OL,9,FJersey in here supporting, it's great
OL,10,Ffor us."
OL,12,FNowacki will return to the pool for
OL,13,Fthe 50m breaststroke on Sunday, before
OL,14,Fcontesting his favoured 200m event on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/6
